✓ Schema Design

=================================================
============================================================
DROP TABLE STATEMENT
============================================================

Category:
Data Definition Language (DDL)

Purpose:
The DROP TABLE statement is used to permanently
remove a table from a database.

When a table is dropped, both its structure and
stored data are deleted.

============================================================
BUSINESS SCENARIO
============================================================

The Persons table is no longer required because
the business has migrated customer information
to a new system.

The old table must be removed from the database.

============================================================
SQL STATEMENT
============================================================
*/

DROP TABLE Persons;



/*
- DROP TABLE
    Removes an existing table.

- Persons
    The table being deleted.


Database Tables

✓ Customers
✓ Orders
✓ Products
✓ Persons

SQL Command:

DROP TABLE Persons;

After:

Database Tables

✓ Customers
✓ Orders
✓ Products

✗ Persons

============================================================
IMPORTANT WARNING
============================================================

DROP TABLE permanently removes:

✓ Table Structure
✓ Rows of Data
✓ Constraints
✓ Relationships

Once executed, recovery may not be possible
unless a backup exists.

============================================================
KEY TAKEAWAY
============================================================

DROP TABLE completely removes a table and everything
contained within it from the database.

Use with caution in production environments.


Question:
What is the difference between DROP and TRUNCATE?

Answer:

DROP TABLE:
- Deletes the table structure
- Deletes all data
- Removes the table completely

TRUNCATE TABLE:
- Deletes only the data
- Keeps the table structure
- Table remains available for use

============================================================
SKILLS DEMONSTRATED
============================================================

